pub const HELP_LINE : str = "tri fpga-rxer -- E3 RX_ER cases in simulation (conformance/eth_rxer_bench.py, about 4.5 min at nice 19): the pinned TB, model and RTL compiled unchanged plus formal/eth_rxer_inject.v as a second top that forces RX_CTL at one falling RXC edge; expectations fixed in NODE_ETHERNET_PLAN.md; exit 1 if any case disagrees. --gate also runs each case on the yosys netlist (the runner's gate_netlist) and requires every INJ/RXE/TXF/TB/UART| line of the gate log to equal the RTL log; each gate run took 28 to 30 min at nice 19 under load (15/15 at 22:35Z, 91b07fd86). Rerun after any E3 RTL change";
